{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/phlm",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/phlm.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.31d.19",
      "source_sha256": "9385e85d40ca4ae2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. Philemon had a quarrel with him, and Onesimus afterwards went to Paul as a fugitive; Paul afterwards wrote this epistle, so that Onesimus might be received."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.31d.20",
      "source_sha256": "698cbf7f6c641755",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. candle-bearer: the name of a grade."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.31d.21",
      "source_sha256": "af1bc29d6248ab74",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in preaching and fulfilling the gospel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.1",
      "source_sha256": "b151fbcd81127da7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "your whole household."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.2",
      "source_sha256": "4c4c9783319a0bd1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for it is manifest, and everyone takes example from it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.3",
      "source_sha256": "125c9359297dcd7e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that you may give and carry out every good thing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.4",
      "source_sha256": "b5da00d90259f675",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. 'useful': that which I need."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.5",
      "source_sha256": "5e74aca55df22c5b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which I have as my very own."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.6",
      "source_sha256": "9f2bc78b6cf2ebde",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for it is so."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.7",
      "source_sha256": "cf3faca2e43c4e78",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. [?] faithful."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.8",
      "source_sha256": "30f1e72ce52f19f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as if it were my own soul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.9",
      "source_sha256": "0456381ffdb1a5a4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I would have wished him to be in my own company because of his faithfulness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.10",
      "source_sha256": "9eb952e771ef3b99",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I am in bonds for the sake of the gospel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.11",
      "source_sha256": "2012feed206cf977",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but I would not have kept him with me unless you approved."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.12",
      "source_sha256": "e37ea9f1a4c84bc3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that it would not be under compulsion that you gave me anything from you, but willingly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.13",
      "source_sha256": "cde67426146aa04f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "there will then be something better from it, i.e. 'that you might receive him for ever', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.14",
      "source_sha256": "8d0c99836a6d7d74",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to serve you; or, eternal in faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.15",
      "source_sha256": "a5834cca530bddd3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'brother': a brother now; he is a brother to you according to the flesh and in the faith of the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.16",
      "source_sha256": "4e853e70ab1ac0dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if you receive me as a friend."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.17",
      "source_sha256": "aea79eec3cfaaf12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as if it were I myself who came to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.18",
      "source_sha256": "b165c04db2aa773e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if anything is owed by him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.19",
      "source_sha256": "04a4b60ceb849221",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "charge it to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.20",
      "source_sha256": "6e2f987c11e4dc31",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. from whatever I can; or, in my prayers; or, so that I may not say to you, 'I have a claim on you', i.e. I will not say that and I will not bring it up against you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.21",
      "source_sha256": "cc188666f90b9da4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. repaying it to me and forgiving it, for the sake of receiving that man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.22",
      "source_sha256": "64c2a4a45ef1a9e8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "there is, however, what I say: 'I [repay] you', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.23",
      "source_sha256": "ebd0d3f875d8191f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "I am eager for his reception (that he be received)."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.24",
      "source_sha256": "5e361de2139cae20",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Provided that you make peace with him, you will do what I say."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.25",
      "source_sha256": "9d743c11b45abb5f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "What you will do will be more than what has been sent to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.26",
      "source_sha256": "378696763d5e18ab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Along with the reception of Onesimus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.27",
      "source_sha256": "65eba30a336677bf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "i.e. I know that it will be granted to you that I come to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.28",
      "source_sha256": "543217336e46d9c6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "We are both in bonds for Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.29",
      "source_sha256": "912b8d33d76e1100",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Greetings are sent to you from them all."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32a.30",
      "source_sha256": "879977c493a67690",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "In preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/phlm#Wb.32b.1",
      "source_sha256": "684be15c5c2b2582",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "i.e. God's help be with you."
    }
  ]
}
